146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Pratapgad is a fort built for one purpose, and it fulfilled it almost immediately. Commissioned by Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj and completed in 1656 under his minister Moropant Trimbak Pingle, it was raised to guard the Par Pass and defend the banks of Koyna rivers. Three years later, it became the site of one of the defining moments of Maratha history the Battle of Pratapgad. Today it's one of the most accessible hill forts in Maharashtra, a straightforward day trip from Mahabaleshwar.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
